    "com.my.televip": {
      "metadata": {
        "added": 1777959803000,
        "categories": [
          "Xposed"
        ],
        "lastUpdated": 1777959804000,
        "sourceCode": "https://github.com/Xposed-Modules-Repo/com.my.televip",
        "authorName": "mustafa1dev",
        "name": {
          "en-US": "TeleVip"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "TeleVip A module for modifying Telegram"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "<h1>TeleVip LSPosed</h1>\n<p>A module for modifying Telegram with the following features:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Hide “Seen” status for groups, channels, and private messages.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Hide “Typing…” indicator.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Hide story view status.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Unlock all restricted and encrypted features for channels.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Boost Telegram download speed.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Enable Telegram Premium features.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Save stories to the gallery, including those that cannot normally be saved.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Change name (Note: The name changes only on your device).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Hide Phone Number</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Hide Online Status</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Prevent Deletion of Secret Media</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Show Deleted Messages</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Disable Stories</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>There are additional features that are not listed here.</p>\n<h1>Support clients</h1>\n<ol>\n<li>Telegram 11.6.1 (55852)</li>\n<li>Plus 11.5.3.0 (21340)</li>\n<li>TG Connect 11.0.1 (1100109)</li>\n<li>Nagram 11.5.3 (1202)</li>\n<li>Skygram 10.20.6 (40639)</li>\n<li>iMe 11.5.3 (11050302)</li>\n<li>X Plus 11.5.4 (55159)</li>\n<li>Cherrygram 11.5.3 (55110)</li>\n<li>Nicegram 1.39.3 (1529)</li>\n<li>Telegram web 11.6.1 (55859)</li>\n<li>Telegram Beta 11.6.1 (55859)</li>\n<li>exteraGram 11.5.3 (55119)</li>\n<li>Nekogram 11.5.3S (55150)</li>\n<li>ForkGram 11.5.3.0 (551108)</li>\n<li>ForkClient Beta 11.5.3.0 (551109)</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Developed by an @mustafa1dev</p>\n"
        },
